    {
      kind: 'sandbox',
      starterCode: "import statistics\ncfds = [2, 4, 5, 5, 7, 8, 9, 10, 12, 14, 23]\nprint('s: %.2f' % statistics.stdev(cfds))\nprint('sigma: %.2f' % statistics.pstdev(cfds))\nq = statistics.quantiles(cfds, n=4)\nprint('IQR: %.2f' % (q[2] - q[0]))\n\ndef draw_box(lo, med, hi, lo_f, hi_f, xs):\n    line = ''\n    for v in range(0, 25):\n        if v == lo or v == med or v == hi:\n            line = line + '|'\n        elif lo < v < hi:\n            line = line + '='\n        elif v == round(hi_f) or v == round(lo_f):\n            line = line + '!'\n        else:\n            line = line + '.'\n    print(line)\n    print('Q1=%s med=%s Q3=%s fences=%s %s' % (lo, med, hi, lo_f, hi_f))\n\ndraw_box(5, 8, 12, -5.5, 22.5, cfds)\n\n# جرّب: احذف 23 من القائمة وأعد الطباعة — كم صار s؟ وأين ذهب الشاذ؟\n# try: delete 23 from the list and reprint — what is s now? where did the outlier go?\n# جرّب: قارن s وsigma قبل وبعد حذف 23 — أيهما تحرك أكثر ولماذا؟\n# try: compare s and sigma before and after deleting 23 — which moved more and why?\n# جرّب: غيّر بياناتك إلى [7, 8, 9, 10, 11] — ما الشكل الجديد للسطر النصي؟\n# try: swap your data to [7, 8, 9, 10, 11] — what is the new shape of the text line?",
