        en: 'The sandbox reads dispersion two ways: library numbers s, sigma and the IQR span, and a character-by-character text boxplot. Delete the outlier and watch which number moves more; swap in a symmetric dataset and watch the line stretch evenly. No tests here — just your curiosity.',
