            en: 'The book\u2019s method excludes the overall median from both halves when n is odd — halves of five and five, Q1 = 5, Q3 = 12. Fold 8 into the upper half and its median becomes 11.0, IQR = 6, upper fence 20.0 — a genuine definitional fork in descriptive statistics we only learned because we build everything by hand.',
