            en: 'stdev divides by n-1 (Bessel\u2019s correction for a sample whose mean you estimated); pstdev by n (the whole population in hand). The practical call: eleven releases from an ongoing process — stdev; every release ever shipped — pstdev. And recall the book\u2019s warning: some other libraries silently divide by n.',
